Q: Null coalescing in PowerShell A: <p>Finally, PowerShell 7 got <a href="https://github.com/PowerShell/PowerShell/pull/10636" rel="nofollow noreferrer">null coalescing assignment operators</a>!</p>
<pre><code>PS &gt; $null ?? &quot;a&quot;
a

PS &gt; &quot;x&quot; ?? &quot;y&quot;
x

PS &gt; $x = $null
PS &gt; $x ??= &quot;abc&quot;
PS &gt; $x
abc

PS &gt; $x ??= &quot;xyz&quot;
PS &gt; $x
abc
</code></pre>
